node_modules/

# Agent scratch, and worktrees kept under it. Local to a machine, and none of
# the other projects in the set track theirs either. It matters more here than
# it looks: the deploy publishes this repository as it stands, with no build
# step to put a clean directory between the source and the site, so anything
# left lying in the tree is a thing the site serves.
.claude/

# Raw harvests. Regenerable with `npm run harvest`, and bulky.
# fixtures/strikes.jsonl is deliberately tracked: it is the deduplicated sample
# every figure in plan.md and the README was measured against, and the check
# runs against it.
fixtures/*.jsonl
!fixtures/strikes.jsonl
*.log

# The build order this was written against. Kept locally, not served.
plan.md
